'''God of War - Odin''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 236
|rarity = UR
|name1 = God of War - Odin
|name2 = God of War - Odin CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''God of War - Odin CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
God of War Odin is an interesting Angel nuker. While he doesn't have the raw firepower of stronger nukers such as [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Jizo's Mega Castle]] or [[Mighty Deth-Troy-R (Uber Rare Cat)|Obliterator Diabolosa]], he makes up for it with a severely lower cooldown. Getting two of Odin on the field doesn't take very long, and their rather high effective HP will let them have their stay on the battlefield. He easily outranges and picks on many Angel enemy types, moreso with the HP, even at level 30, to brush off the attacks of [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] and take punishment from two entire [[St. Dober]] [[Surge Attack|Surges]] and still live!

When considering other anti-Angels with low cooldown, however, [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kalisa]] becomes a strong contender for having more than twice the DPS of Odin and a cooldown that's even lower. They both their own strengths, with Kalisa having brute force and Odin having sustainability, so either can be chosen based on the player's needs for a stage and both do very well against Angels regardless.

{{Job|Classification = Nuker & Tanker}}

